---
slug: mcp
method: delete
---
{%- comment -%}
  DELETE /mcp answers 405 Method Not Allowed: the endpoint is POST-only. The server
  keeps no session for a client to terminate; the 2025-06-18 Streamable HTTP transport
  allows 405 for a session DELETE, and 2026-07-28 recommends 405 for clients of earlier
  revisions.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign allow = { "Allow": "POST" }
  assign allow_json = allow | json
  response_headers allow_json
  response_status 405
-%}
